/target
# Nested per-crate target dirs (e.g. when criterion benches are
# run from a crate subdirectory).  Same Rust artefacts as the
# root /target — never tracked.
**/target/
# **v6.8.10 — 2026-06-23 external advisor flag.**  Live REPL
# sessions append to this file via the rejection-detector journal
# (`crate::adam_voice_repl_v6_3::session_journal::correction_persisted`).
# It is a RUNTIME artefact, not a source of truth — tracking it
# meant every voice REPL session left a dirty working tree.  The
# file is untracked from v6.8.10 onward; runtime continues to
# write to it.  History is preserved in git as the file was
# tracked through v6.8.9.
data/mistake_corrections.jsonl
