# **v6.8.34 — 2026-06-29 ingestion pipeline.**  `data/ingestion/`
# is the live candidate queue between extractor, validator,
# reviewer, and integrator (see `crates/adam-ingestion/`).
# Like `data/mistake_corrections.jsonl`, it is a RUNTIME
# artefact, not a source of truth — committing it would mean
# every pipeline run left a dirty working tree.  The CI gate
# (`validate_ingestion`) degrades to silent success when the
# directory is absent.
data/ingestion/
# Raw text staged for the extractor (PDF text dumps, scraped
